WEBVTT

00:00:07.032 --> 00:00:08.232
(WHOOPING)

00:00:08.672 --> 00:00:11.552
There you go! Felt good!

00:00:13.232 --> 00:00:14.752
Hey, what was my speed?

00:00:15.152 --> 00:00:17.272
I don't know.
I can only track you on the treadmill.

00:00:17.712 --> 00:00:18.712
No treadmills!

00:00:19.392 --> 00:00:20.672
Oh! What about Hamilton?

00:00:20.752 --> 00:00:21.752
ELECTRONIC MALE VOICE:
Hamilton here.

00:00:22.032 --> 00:00:24.752
Who's Hamilton?
My electronic personal assistant.

00:00:24.912 --> 00:00:26.752
You know, like on your phone.

00:00:26.832 --> 00:00:28.432
You do have a phone, don't you?

00:00:28.632 --> 00:00:31.112
Racecars don't have phones, Cruz.

00:00:31.272 --> 00:00:33.752
Hamilton, track Mr. McQueen's
speed and report it.

00:00:33.952 --> 00:00:36.312
-Tracking.
-I'll stay as close as I can.

00:00:36.472 --> 00:00:38.432
Your suit will transmit
your speeds to Hamilton.

00:00:38.592 --> 00:00:40.912
Fine. Whatever. Let's do this.

00:00:42.632 --> 00:00:43.952
Quicker than quick, faster than fast,

00:00:44.072 --> 00:00:45.472
I am speed. Come on, Luigi.

00:00:45.672 --> 00:00:48.152
On your mark, get set, and go!

00:00:48.392 --> 00:00:54.312
HAMILTON: 46 miles per hour.
63 miles. Out of range.

00:00:55.432 --> 00:00:56.472
Huh.

00:00:56.552 --> 00:00:58.952
That's odd. I didn't go!

00:00:59.472 --> 00:01:00.672
(REVVING)

00:01:01.072 --> 00:01:04.632
On sand you got to ease into your start
so your tires can grab, okay?

00:01:04.792 --> 00:01:07.672
-Okay.
-You do work with racecars, don't you?

00:01:07.832 --> 00:01:09.672
Yeah, but never outside.

00:01:09.752 --> 00:01:10.792
All right. Let's go again.

00:01:11.032 --> 00:01:12.272
Go!

00:01:13.792 --> 00:01:15.832
HAMILTON: 54 miles per hour.

00:01:15.992 --> 00:01:18.352
75 miles per hour. Out of range.

00:01:18.672 --> 00:01:20.312
-Huh?
-(HAMILTON REPEATING)

00:01:21.512 --> 00:01:24.112
Sorry! Got stuck!

00:01:24.632 --> 00:01:26.672
-Go again!
-And go!

00:01:27.312 --> 00:01:29.112
-Ah! Sorry!
-LUIGI: Go!

00:01:29.392 --> 00:01:30.472
Whoa!

00:01:30.592 --> 00:01:32.352
-Go!
-(ENGINE REVVING)

00:01:34.632 --> 00:01:35.952
The beach ate me.

00:01:36.192 --> 00:01:39.112
McQUEEN: All right, Cruz,
pick a line on the compacted sand.

00:01:39.272 --> 00:01:41.192
You got to have traction
or you're gonna spin out.

00:01:41.592 --> 00:01:42.672
Let's do this thing!

00:01:42.752 --> 00:01:44.512
On your mark, get set, go!

00:01:45.672 --> 00:01:47.672
HAMILTON: 122 miles per hour.

00:01:47.792 --> 00:01:51.272
134 miles-- Out of range.

00:01:51.832 --> 00:01:54.472
-Now what?
-I didn't want to hit a crab!

00:01:54.672 --> 00:01:57.512
-You got to be kidding me.
-What? It was cute!

00:01:57.912 --> 00:01:58.952
(McQUEEN GROANS)

00:02:00.992 --> 00:02:03.832
McQUEEN: All right, one last chance
to try this before it gets dark.

00:02:04.032 --> 00:02:05.912
Now, you're going to take off slow

00:02:05.992 --> 00:02:07.032
to let your tires grab.

00:02:07.192 --> 00:02:09.352
And pick a straight line on hard sand

00:02:09.432 --> 00:02:11.192
-so you don't spin out.
-Uh-huh.

00:02:11.232 --> 00:02:14.192
And all of the crabbies
have gone night-night.

00:02:14.352 --> 00:02:15.432
Mr. McQueen.

00:02:15.592 --> 00:02:17.032
All right. Let's go again.

00:02:17.192 --> 00:02:18.552
And go!

00:02:21.512 --> 00:02:25.992
150 miles per hour. 175 miles per hour.

00:02:26.152 --> 00:02:28.712
196 miles per hour.

00:02:31.152 --> 00:02:34.272
(WHOOPING)
All right! Finally! You made it!

00:02:34.352 --> 00:02:36.032
Congratulations! How'd I do?

00:02:36.472 --> 00:02:39.392
-You topped out at 198.
-198? That's it?

00:02:39.712 --> 00:02:40.992
Still slower than Storm.

00:02:43.072 --> 00:02:44.472
Wasted my whole day.

00:02:44.632 --> 00:02:45.752
I wouldn't say that.

00:02:45.912 --> 00:02:49.152
It did feel great to be
out here doing real racing.

00:02:49.392 --> 00:02:51.912
This isn't real racing. We're on a beach!

00:02:52.072 --> 00:02:54.672
All you do is go straight.
How am I gonna get faster if I don't--

00:02:57.912 --> 00:02:59.352
Thunder Hollow.

00:03:00.512 --> 00:03:03.352
Thunder Hollow!
There's a dirt track there!

00:03:03.512 --> 00:03:06.912
That's what I need!
To race against actual racers.

00:03:07.552 --> 00:03:10.072
No! Too public! If the press find you,

00:03:10.072 --> 00:03:13.032
they will be like many bugs on you.

00:03:13.232 --> 00:03:15.752
-Paparazzi! (SPITS)
-Guys, I really need this!

00:03:15.912 --> 00:03:20.552
Ah, just leave it to me, boss.
I am a master of disguise.

00:03:22.072 --> 00:03:23.632
(COUNTRY MUSIC PLAYING)

00:03:29.752 --> 00:03:31.112
-(CAMERAS CLICKING)
-(CARS HONKING)

00:03:31.192 --> 00:03:33.392
FEMALE CAR: All right! Next!

00:03:33.832 --> 00:03:35.512
(WHISTLING TUNE)

00:03:41.832 --> 00:03:42.872
(COUGHS AND SPITS)

00:03:42.952 --> 00:03:45.152
You, sir, are officially incognito.

00:03:45.272 --> 00:03:46.592
Nobody's bothering you.

00:03:46.952 --> 00:03:49.032
The great Lightning McQueen.

00:03:49.392 --> 00:03:53.232
I can feel it, guys.
Tonight is the night I find my speed!

00:03:53.392 --> 00:03:57.152
ANNOUNCER: Racers, get on over
to the startin' line. Pronto!

00:03:57.392 --> 00:03:58.992
(ALL CHATTERING)

00:03:59.032 --> 00:04:01.272
All right! No more straight lines.

00:04:01.312 --> 00:04:02.952
Just a good old-fashioned oval.

00:04:03.312 --> 00:04:04.992
Hey, now! You that out-of-towner?

00:04:05.272 --> 00:04:08.272
Uh, yes. That's me!
Chester Whipplefilter.

00:04:08.432 --> 00:04:11.232
And I'm Frances Beltline.

00:04:11.392 --> 00:04:13.312
-Cruz, what are you doing?
-I'm your trainer.

00:04:13.472 --> 00:04:16.312
I'm gonna track your speed
from the infield, Whipplefilter.

00:04:16.712 --> 00:04:18.552
Fine. Just stay out of the way.

00:04:18.712 --> 00:04:21.432
Excuse me, sir?
Where are the other racers?

00:04:21.752 --> 00:04:23.152
Oh, they'll be along.

00:04:23.232 --> 00:04:27.432
We always let our guests
start right up front.

00:04:27.792 --> 00:04:30.512
-(DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING)
-(CROWD CHEERING)

00:04:30.592 --> 00:04:33.472
ANNOUNCER: Welcome, y'all,
to Thunder Hollow Speedway...

00:04:34.232 --> 00:04:39.512
for tonight's edition of Crazy Eight!

00:04:49.392 --> 00:04:50.872
Did he say Crazy Eight?

00:04:50.912 --> 00:04:52.112
Whoa.

00:04:52.192 --> 00:04:53.312
ANNOUNCER: Race fans!

00:04:53.712 --> 00:04:57.232
It's time to meet tonight's challengers!

00:04:58.672 --> 00:05:00.712
-(SIREN CHIRPS)
-(IMITATING SIREN SOUNDS)

00:05:00.832 --> 00:05:02.392
-Have a nice trip!
-(EVIL LAUGHTER)

00:05:03.632 --> 00:05:05.072
Protect and swerve!

00:05:05.952 --> 00:05:07.152
(ALL LAUGHING MANIACALLY)

00:05:08.032 --> 00:05:09.712
(WHOOPING)

00:05:09.952 --> 00:05:11.392
(WHISTLING TUNE)

00:05:12.632 --> 00:05:14.232
Cruz! This isn't what I thought it was.

00:05:14.312 --> 00:05:15.552
Come on, follow me and we'll slip out.

00:05:17.192 --> 00:05:20.712
Rule number one:
the gate closes, you race.

00:05:21.352 --> 00:05:23.392
CRUZ: (GASPS) Wait!
No, no, no. I'm not a racer.

00:05:23.712 --> 00:05:26.352
Rule number two: last car standing wins.

00:05:26.512 --> 00:05:30.232
And rule number three:
no cursing! It's Family Night.

00:05:30.552 --> 00:05:33.472
-Excuse me, sir?
-Wait. No, I'm just a trainer!

00:05:33.552 --> 00:05:35.192
-Whoo!
-(BOTH YELPING)

00:05:36.392 --> 00:05:39.632
ANNOUNCER: And make way for
the undefeated Crazy Eight champion...

00:05:39.992 --> 00:05:44.992
the Diva of Demolition, Miss Fritter!

00:05:46.312 --> 00:05:47.472
(SCREAMING)

00:05:48.312 --> 00:05:49.272
Boo! (LAUGHS)

00:05:50.872 --> 00:05:53.792
Lookie here, boys.
We got us a couple of rookies.

00:05:53.952 --> 00:05:58.792
I'm gonna call you Muddy Britches
and you Lemonade.

00:05:59.232 --> 00:06:01.512
Hey, neither one of them
has a single dent.

00:06:01.672 --> 00:06:03.552
Oh, I'm gonna fix that!

00:06:04.112 --> 00:06:10.232
All right, everybody! Let's go racing!

00:06:10.472 --> 00:06:11.952
(CROWD CHEERING)

00:06:12.712 --> 00:06:13.872
(MISS FRITTER LAUGHS)

00:06:15.752 --> 00:06:18.112
I'm about to commit a moving violation.

00:06:18.232 --> 00:06:19.272
-McQUEEN: Ow.
-(GRUNTS)

00:06:19.792 --> 00:06:21.672
-Boo!
-(CROWD CHEERING)

00:06:22.352 --> 00:06:23.592
(GASPING)

00:06:31.152 --> 00:06:31.912
Cruz!

00:06:32.632 --> 00:06:33.312
RACER: Ha-ha! Watch out.

00:06:33.912 --> 00:06:36.152
What are you doing?
Got to keep moving!

00:06:36.352 --> 00:06:37.512
I shouldn't be out here! (SHRIEKS)

00:06:37.992 --> 00:06:39.792
-Move, Cruz! Move!
-(SCREAMS)

00:06:40.272 --> 00:06:41.752
What do I do? I can't steer!

00:06:41.912 --> 00:06:43.072
Turn right to go left!
Turn right to go left!

00:06:43.472 --> 00:06:44.472
That doesn't make any sense!

00:06:44.552 --> 00:06:45.992
Turn right to go left!

00:06:46.872 --> 00:06:47.992
(RACER WHOOPING)

00:06:48.472 --> 00:06:49.632
(MANIACAL LAUGHTER)

00:06:50.032 --> 00:06:51.112
-Whoa.
-(RACER CAR WHIMPERING)

00:06:53.112 --> 00:06:54.792
-Hey, Patty.
-Oh, hey, Bill!

00:06:54.992 --> 00:06:57.112
Ahhh! (YELPS)

00:06:58.472 --> 00:06:59.592
(GRUNTS)

00:07:01.672 --> 00:07:03.112
(CREAKING)

00:07:03.152 --> 00:07:04.272
(WHOOPING)

00:07:04.472 --> 00:07:08.152
Look, Ma, I can drive-- Oh, man!

00:07:10.312 --> 00:07:11.872
Nice day for a drive, huh?

00:07:12.032 --> 00:07:13.992
Hey, buddy!
Get the (HONKS) out of my way!

00:07:14.232 --> 00:07:16.272
-Whoo-hoo!
-(CROWD CHEERING)

00:07:17.392 --> 00:07:18.912
Hey! I'm driving--

00:07:18.992 --> 00:07:20.192
-(IMITATING SIREN)
-(LAUGHS)

00:07:21.352 --> 00:07:22.392
(GRUNTS)

00:07:22.472 --> 00:07:23.672
(WHIMPERS)

00:07:23.712 --> 00:07:24.872
(GASPS)

00:07:25.792 --> 00:07:27.792
-Oh, look at my new hat!
-(McQUEEN SCREAMING)

00:07:29.592 --> 00:07:31.352
(ALL SCREAMING)

00:07:31.632 --> 00:07:34.352
SUPERFLY: I'm flying!
No! I'm not flying!

00:07:35.392 --> 00:07:37.352
-(CROWD EXCLAIMING)
-CAR: Get it. Get it.

00:07:37.472 --> 00:07:38.512
-I got it!
-(CHEERING)

00:07:41.192 --> 00:07:43.112
-Cruz!
-(SCREAMING)

00:07:44.992 --> 00:07:46.472
(IMITATING SIREN SOUND)

00:07:48.552 --> 00:07:50.192
Oh!

00:07:51.472 --> 00:07:52.912
CABBIE TAXI: Hey, buddy! Move it!

00:07:53.872 --> 00:07:55.832
Turn right to go left.
Turn right to go left.

00:07:56.232 --> 00:07:57.952
Whoa, whoa. Whoa!

